+The generator reminds the dispatcher at build time and never refuses (D196): `DBG-CHECKPOINTED-OWNER` names another started, unfinished slice of the same item with the grant-and-resume commands and the release route (`slice-queue.mjs cancel <id> --started --reason "<why>" --class budget`); `DBG-ESTIMATE-ABOVE-BASE` fires when `estimatedToolCalls` exceeds the base cap and `budgetRationale` does not say a grant is planned; `DBG-ESTIMATE-NEEDS-SPLIT` asks for a split along independent criteria when the estimate exceeds twice the base cap plus one grant step of 30.
+
